## Scope

This license covers the original text, structure, custom diagrams
(SVGs), stylesheets, and JavaScript authored for this guide, under
docs/ (excluding the third-party assets listed below).

It does NOT cover:

- Quoted excerpts from external papers, GitHub issues, and training
  material cited throughout this guide. Those remain the copyright of
  their respective authors and are reproduced here under attribution /
  short-quotation practice, with a source link at each use.
- Data and images fetched from the AlphaFold Protein Structure Database
  (EMBL-EBI / DeepMind), which carry their own CC BY 4.0 license — see
  the "Data source & license" note on docs/example-protein.md.
- The vendored Mol* viewer (docs/assets/molstar/), which is MIT-licensed
  by its own authors — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
